	"name": "Two-Column Form Section",
	"library": "bootstrap",
	"category": "forms",
	"description": "Two-column form section in the Bootstrap style — heading and caption over a name pair with a full-width email row, required asterisks, and library-native field chrome. Interactive controls and editable values; saves private Things through an Action.",
